    A2("archive.extract_tar","解压 tar 归档","Extract tar archive","把 tar 归档解压到指定目录","Extract tar archive into a directory","tar extract archive 解压",CAT_ARCHIVE,RISK_SENSITIVE,"mkdir -p -- {2} && tar -xf {1} -C {2}","请输入 tar 归档路径。","Enter tar archive path.",NULL,ARG_PATH,"请输入目标目录。","Enter destination directory.",".",ARG_PATH),
